@sprint3 @issue-17 @chatbot @whatsapp @escalation
Feature: [Issue #17] Fitur Eskalasi Pertanyaan Chatbot ke WhatsApp Ketua RT
  As a resident using the Tanya RT chatbot service
  I want unanswered or out-of-scope administrative questions to be escalated to the RT head via WhatsApp
  So that I can receive direct clarification and personalized assistance from the RT administrator

  Background:
    Given the RTConnect backend application is ready
    And the resident "resident@example.test" and the RT head "rt@example.test" are logged in with password "LocalTestOnly#2026"
    And the RT WhatsApp contact number is configured to "6281234567890"

  Scenario: Pertanyaan di luar basis pengetahuan RT otomatis dieskalasi ke WhatsApp Ketua RT
    When the resident sends a chatbot query "Kapan turnamen catur internasional diselenggarakan?"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the response field "data.is_escalated" should be true
    And the response field "data.similarity_score" should be less than 0.70
    And the response field "data.escalation_whatsapp_url" should contain "https://wa.me/6281234567890"
    And the response field "data.escalation_whatsapp_url" should contain "text="

  Scenario: Status sesi obrolan diperbarui menjadi dieskalasi di basis data
    When the resident sends a chatbot query "Kapan turnamen catur internasional diselenggarakan?"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the chat session status in database should become "dieskalasi"

  Scenario: Sistem membuat notifikasi eskalasi obrolan baru untuk Ketua RT
    When the resident sends a chatbot query "Kapan turnamen catur internasional diselenggarakan?"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the RT head notification inbox should contain an unread "eskalasi_chat" notification

  Scenario: Pertanyaan administrasi RT yang valid dijawab langsung tanpa eskalasi WhatsApp
    When the resident sends a chatbot query "Berapa lama masa berlaku surat pengantar RT?"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the response field "data.is_escalated" should be false
    And the response field "data.similarity_score" should be greater than or equal to 0.70
    And the response field "data.escalation_whatsapp_url" should be null

  Scenario: Warga dapat melihat daftar sesi obrolan dan riwayat pesan sesi yang dieskalasi
    Given the resident has an escalated chat session with query "Kapan turnamen catur internasional diselenggarakan?"
    When the resident retrieves the chatbot session history
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the chatbot session list should include the escalated session
    When the resident retrieves the messages for the escalated session
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the session messages should include both "warga" and "sistem_ai" entries

  Scenario: Warga dilarang mengirim pertanyaan menggunakan session ID milik warga lain
    Given another resident has an active chatbot session
    When the resident attempts to send a query to the other resident's chatbot session
    Then the response status code should be 403
    And the response JSON should indicate failure
    And the response field "error" should be "FORBIDDEN"

  Scenario: Pengiriman pertanyaan chatbot ditolak tanpa token autentikasi
    When an unauthenticated user sends a chatbot query "Halo selamat pagi"
    Then the response status code should be 401
    And the response JSON should indicate failure
    And the response field "error" should be "UNAUTHORIZED"
